Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:03.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,Gujarat has a desert made not of sand,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.57,0:00:04.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,but of salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.54,0:00:07.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,And on full-moon nights, it turns silver.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.90,0:00:11.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the Great Rann of Kutch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.12,0:00:13.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the monsoon, it fills with water.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.61,0:00:15.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then the water dries up,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.27,0:00:17.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,leaving a white sheet of salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.40,0:00:21.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,In winter, Rann Utsav is held near Dhordo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.74,0:00:24.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,This season it runs from 1 November 2026
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.93,0:00:26.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,to 7 March 2027.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.25,0:00:30.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,The most special nights are the full moons.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.54,0:00:33.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,This season's first: 23 to 25 November,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.52,0:00:35.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,which means right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.20,0:00:37.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then December, January and February.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.00,0:00:42.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,Under the moon, the white desert looks silver,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.56,0:00:46.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,and evenings bring Kutchi folk music and dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.25,0:00:49.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,Have you seen the white Rann?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.60,0:00:50.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Comment: rann.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.74,0:00:53.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,And send this to the one you'd go with.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.95,0:00:57.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stories of Gujarat, on the otlo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.60,0:00:58.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Follow Otlo.
